			"notes": "> [!NOTE]\n> From now on all commands can be accessed from the `decree` command.\n> Some commands still offer a top-level command node, but this may change in the future.\n> This was done to reduce possible naming conflicts in the future.\n\n- Fix name command changes item name instead of custom name\n- Name command now defaults to main hand instead of the first slot.\n- Changed mod name to `Decree`\n- Change `cpride` command to `decree ride`\n- Change `cpstop` command to `decree stop`\n- Remove aliases (for now)\n- Improve error handling on `gamerulepreset` command\n- Begin work on command config API"
		},
